  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "TW",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "小女孩JOJO撿到百萬籌碼，為讓欠債跑路的父親返家故需找人進賭場代賭，她遇上背負房貸壓力的志華，同樣缺錢的兩人決定合作，怎知過程中各懷心思，以為能換來幸福的籌碼最後成了一場空，卻意外收穫一段珍貴的情誼。",
          "runtime": 116,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Young Jojo suddenly comes into a stack of casino chips worth a million and decides to pay off her runaway father’s debt, asking the down-on-his-luck debt collector Hua to gamble on her behalf. In Macau’s chaotic casinos, they form an unlikely alliance, navigating wins, losses, and life’s challenges together. When the final bet arrives, fate cruelly tests them, stripping them of everything, yet revealing the true gift life has been offering. I Blew Out the Candle Before Making a Wish explores money, family, and responsibility, capturing the shadows and resilience of human nature.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "I Blew Out the Candles Before Making a Wish"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "HK",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "從天而降的百萬籌碼，讓小女孩JOJO動了幫走佬父親還債的念頭，為了將「天主的禮物」化成現金，JOJO央求來家裡收數的志華替她進賭場代賭。一事無成的志華目標只有追回已經變心的妻子，他以為保住層樓才有機會追回她，但奈何他連這個月供樓錢都沒有。  急需金錢的兩人一拍即合，通過賭桌上翻轉的牌面，贏錢的喜悅逐漸拉近兩人距離。可久賭必輸，JOJO和志華決定利用僅存的籌碼放手一博，豈料事情並非那麼單純，命運的玩笑讓兩人失去所有，也在那一刻，JOJO和志華才真正收到上天給予的禮物。",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "我未許願先吹蠟燭"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "IT",
        "iso_639_1": "it",
        "name": "Italiano",
        "english_name": "Italian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "La giovane Jojo e il consumato Hua sono gli improbabili compari di questa avventura che si interroga sulla famiglia e le responsabilità, catturando le ombre e la resilienza della natura umana. Jojo si ritrova con un mucchio di fiches e Hua le gioca per conto suo nei caotici casinò di Macao. I due stringono un'alleanza inaspettata, affrontando insieme vittorie e sconfitte. Quando arrivano alla scommessa finale, scoprono il vero dono che la vita gli ha offerto.",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "I Blew Out the Candles Before Making a Wish"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "CN",
        "iso_639_1": "zh",
        "name": "普通话",
        "english_name": "Mandarin",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "小女孩JoJo（梅静妍 饰）身怀百万的赌场筹码，因为奶奶（金燕玲 饰）病倒了，她阴错阳差下雇用了来自台湾的讨债废柴志华（柯震东 饰）进赌场代赌。 一大一小各怀鬼胎，展开一次相亲相爱又相骗的老千行动。",
          "runtime": 116,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "我未许愿先吹蜡烛"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
